      "desc:8": "The §9Pellet Injector Hatch§r sits in the socket on the top collar of the T9 collimator stack and fires pellets down the axis into the core. It fires the highest grade it holds, or the one locked in its GUI.\n\nIts rate cap comes from the §9Injector Barrel§r in its slot: §9Mk I 4, Mk II 8, Mk III 16§r pellets a second. Superdense pellets on a Mk I already hold every flow.\n- Mk I: Condensate Assembler, UXV (Casimir Plates, UMV Field Generators, Jet Collimator Rings, SpaceTime).\n- Mk II: 4 Mk I + Entangled Antipolarization Agent. Mk III: 4 Mk II + 16,000 L Superdense Ergomatter (Assembly Line).\n\nBelow T9 the injector does nothing except the Deep Link's test fire. ME stocking buses are fine on it: pellets are upkeep, not a trim.\n\n§2§lDONE §lWHEN§r you hold an Injector Barrel Mk I, then fit it with the hatch.",
